     "texto": [
      "**Eu, no teu lugar, falaria com ela** (I, in your place, would speak to her). **Eu faria o mesmo** (I would do the same)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Deveria and seria melhor",
     "texto": [
      "**Deveria** + infinitive = you should: **Deveria descansar** (you should rest).",
      "**Seria melhor** + infinitive = it would be better: **Seria melhor ir cedo** (it would be better to go early)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
